41	story_opening	{"heading_1": "When we saw Excitement", "heading_2": "Turning Into Overthinking", "paragraphs": ["Elewen was born from noticing a simple truth: many people love the idea of hosting, but hesitate because planning an event often feels like too much to manage.", "Finding reliable vendors, understanding fair pricing, and coordinating everything usually means relying on social media, referrals, and endless back-and-forth."]}	1	\N
42	celebrations_matter	{"heading": "Celebrations Don't Have to Be Big to Matter", "paragraphs": ["Hosting a party, celebrating with close friends and family, and taking a pause from everyday life truly matters.", "Elewen exists to protect that feeling. We focus on the little details and personal touches that turn simple gatherings into meaningful moments."]}	2	\N
43	simple_question	{"body": "Almost everything else in our lives has moved online. We book cabs and holidays in minutes, so why does event planning still feel complicated?", "heading": "We Asked a Simple Question"}	3	\N
44	thoughtful_gatherings	{"heading": "Thoughtful Gatherings Over Loud Distractions?", "paragraphs": ["With house parties becoming the new way to celebrate, it felt like the right time to bring digitalisation, organisation, and standardisation to the events space.", "Built on trust & to save time, Elewen is a one-stop digital platform that makes hosting simpler with genuine pricing, and seamless planning.", "And that's how Elewen came to be!"]}	4	\N
46	why_choose	{"heading": "Why Choose Elewen", "features": [{"note": "packages from ???6k", "label": "Little details that lift your party"}, {"label": "One complete look. Zero running around."}, {"label": "A few clicks and you're done planning"}, {"label": "Behind the scenes? That's on us."}], "subheading": "Everything you need for a beautiful celebration, thoughtfully brought together."}	6	\N
47	vendor_quality	{"body": "We stand by the people behind every celebration, creating steady work, clear processes, and timely payments for vendors.", "cards": [{"title": "Quality you can trust", "description": "Every partner in the Elewen Network is quality-checked for skill, reliability, and consistency."}, {"title": "Built for everyone involved", "description": "By removing middlemen, we give customers better value and help our partners work in a more organised, digital, and timely system."}, {"title": "Clear tiers. Simple Choices", "description": "Our partners are grouped into three levels. You choose your package, and we take care of the rest."}], "heading": "Our approach to vendor quality"}	7	\N
